cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it together with the accompanying RLDS papers."
title: "rlds-paired: Paired Dark-Sector Signature SDK"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation for the paired growth-suppression signature of the
  Regime-Limited Dynamical Systems (RLDS) interacting dark-sector model,
  accompanying RLDS Papers III-V. Recomputes the headline results (paired
  coefficient, spectral gap, attractor, present-day matter fraction) directly
  from the model rather than storing literals.
